u}_{B\infty} = R_H \left( \dfrac{1}{4} - 0 ight) = \dfrac{1}{4} R_H$<br>Ratio = $\dfrac{1}{1/4} = 4:1$. Statement (D) is correct.<br><br>Thus, statements (A), (C), and (D) are correct.<br><br>Answer: (A), (C) and (D) only

